OL,3,AEU offers UK fresh deal on 'Made in    
OL,4,AEurope' scheme                         
OL,6,FSenior figures in the British          
OL,7,Fgovernment have been talking           
OL,8,Fincreasingly positively about the      
OL,9,Fpotential to join on terms London would
OL,10,Fbe willing to sign up to, and are      
OL,11,Fcautiously optimistic about this latest
OL,12,Fmove.                                  
